          "status": "generated",
          "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p><b>Diane Roe</b>, 49-year-old female (DOB 1977-06-22). Stage IIIA primary malignant neoplasm of the right breast, diagnosed March 2024. HER2-positive by IHC (3+). ECOG Performance Status 0 — fully active.</p><p><b>Expected CDS outcome:</b> All required data elements present; ECOG 0 meets pre-authorization criteria. CRD returns pre-authorization, but payer formulary requires biosimilar substitution: trastuzumab → trastuzumab-dttb (Ontrudy). The SMART app surfaces this payer modification to the ordering clinician.</p></div>"
